d05-46ea-8f98-60ecc0442316"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"从空队列连续插入 $N$ 次总耗时为 $O(N)$, 每次插入的摊还代价为 $O(1)$"}]}}},{"path":"versions/9cea2296-0f4a-42fd-981d-01f2845cdcbf/ae57f721f6577aa2bdf0a0a867ae3dd22000575b589bd322d1af0d8ffacfca45.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"9cea2296-0f4a-42fd-981d-01f2845cdcbf","revision":"sha256:ae57f721f6577aa2bdf0a0a867ae3dd22000575b589bd322d1af0d8ffacfca45","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"Merge the two binomial queues in the following figure. Which one of the following statements must be FALSE?"},{"type":"image","src":"../../assets/0599ce21fa14655acb5ecd49407c1c16f4d3a1fd2e2ba54fd4c3fb7be76abbf5.jpg","alt":"题图"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"there are two binomial trees after merging, which are $B_2$ and $B_4$","correct":false,"option_id":"091437e9-ab9e-4904-9a45-2bfb5c6cb157"},{"type":"text","content":"13 and 15 are the children of 4","correct":false,"option_id":"d045b086-585e-41ec-9d80-050159a83c3b"},{"type":"text","content":"if 23 is a child of 2, then 12 must be another child of 2","correct":false,"option_id":"4b5130b2-455a-4a22-af73-08c4c0126207"},{"type":"text","content":"if 4 is a child of 2, then 23 must be another child of 2","correct":true,"option_id":"c41849d7-37f1-4af8-8020-14ed63b5432e"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"合并时若 4 成为 2 的孩子, 23 可以独立成为 $B_2$ 的根"}]}}},{"path":"versions/42b41f60-cf9e-4504-aa1c-92049ed6eec0/5f1e0826932dbbfce98c3b4d085c76f8ea62a6122368d0e6ea3c7a5308d81c4c.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"42b41f60-cf9e-4504-aa1c-92049ed6eec0","revision":"sha256:5f1e0826932dbbfce98c3b4d085c76f8ea62a6122368d0e6ea3c7a5308d81c4c","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"Delete the minimum number from the given binomial queues in the following 